        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">For brands, YouTube Shorts offers a cost-effective way to reach a massive and growing audience. YouTube Shorts receives over 70 billion daily views globally, and Shorts Ads allow brands to appear in this high-engagement feed. CPMs for Shorts Ads are typically 30-50% lower than standard YouTube video ads, making it an efficient awareness and consideration channel.</p>
